note notes <regex>: search what earlier sessions wrote. The agent reaches for it so a session does not re-investigate what an earlier session already understood and wrote down (design.md section 5). Matches the regex against every line of every path note and step note and prints each matching line with where it lives, so a session can find prior explanation before reading code.

